    trivia: '“Before deciding” places a choice in the future. Jun asks for information at that stage. Reporting that he is considering options is different from saying he has already submitted a complaint or agreed to an interview.', triviaQuestion: ['Does asking about options establish that Jun has filed a complaint?', 'No. The account leaves the next action undecided.'],
